# Express Stack Standards (disabled)

This project does **not** use Express.js. Backend APIs live under `app/api/*` with `handleApiRoute` → controllers → Firestore (`app/_server/`). Do not apply Express-specific requirements (helmet, `/api/v1`, BullMQ, etc.) to this codebase.

